-- תחום תנאי שירות עובדי הוראה — חוזרים ונהלים לבעלויות
-- The department's index of its circulars and procedures to the owners, by
-- school year, with the titles of their annexes and forms. A web page of the
-- department, not part of the takanon; it states no rule. The circulars
-- themselves are the corpus's own documents.

IMPORT prelude

§ `חוזרים ונהלים לבעלויות`

-- not weighed against `the Minimum Wage Law`: two of the titles the page
-- lists (circulars 3 and 5 of תשס"ו) name an update of the minimum-wage
-- figure ("עדכון שכר מינימום"); the page is an index of the department's
-- circulars and rules nothing on the minimum wage.

-- not weighed against `the Sick Pay Law`: five of the titles the page lists
-- name sick days — circular תשע"ג/5 on their use and redemption in Oz
-- LaTmura, circular תשס"ט/7 on the redemption of unused days, and three
-- procedures on reimbursing the owners for it and carrying days to it; the
-- page is an index and rules nothing on sick pay (the two circulars are
-- weighed in their own files).

-- not weighed against `the Annual Leave Law`: three of the titles the page
-- lists name leave — the change of the upper division's recess calendar
-- from תשפ"ה, circular תשע"ה/6 on the four days of vacation made up, and
-- circular תשס"ט/7 on redeeming sick days; the page is an index and rules
-- nothing on leave (the circulars are weighed in their own files).

-- akn:hc_1 The portal's breadcrumb and the page title; no rule.
-- akn:hc_2 The page's list of school years; navigation, no rule.
-- akn:hc_3 akn:hc_4 akn:hc_5 akn:hc_6 Headings and titles of the procedures and circulars of the latest years; links to documents, no rule.
-- akn:att_1__hc_1 akn:att_6__hc_1 akn:att_11__hc_1 akn:att_14__hc_1 akn:att_20__hc_1 akn:att_25__hc_1 akn:att_29__hc_1 akn:att_32__hc_1 akn:att_36__hc_1 akn:att_41__hc_1 akn:att_46__hc_1 akn:att_51__hc_1 akn:att_53__hc_1 Titles of circulars, procedures, annexes and forms by school year; links to documents, no rule.
